{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "50f3ddbb-0176-8553-af5a-7be4be1ac781",
  "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:55:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:52:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Gina Cirelli. I know it's Saturday and City Hall is closed, so I called the storm number like the recording said."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:52:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got the right place, Mrs. Cirelli. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The water. From that nor'easter, the one that came in Friday and finished up today. It comes down the hill from the next street over and runs straight into my yard. Straight in. And the drain out front is not taking any of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:53:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:53:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-five Gibbs Avenue. That's the Ocean Drive side. [pause] Three. Five. Gibbs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thirty-five Gibbs. Is the water getting into the house, or is it the yard and the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:53:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The yard. It's sitting out there like a pond. I'm not happy about it, I'll tell you that. I rent, so it's not mine to fix, but somebody ought to look at that drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:53:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request for a crew to check the storm drain out front. They're pretty busy after a storm like this, so I can't give you an hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:53:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I figured. I took pictures, you know. Of the water coming down and the yard. I can send them to you if that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. Hang on, let me find where to send those. Actually, I'll note it on the request and someone can follow up with you about the photos. Is this the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:54:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's four, zero, one. [pause] Five, five, five. [pause] Zero, one, five, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And I'd like a call back when it's done. Not before. When somebody has actually looked at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll write that down, a call back once the work is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I wasn't even going to call, but I went out this morning, I walk three miles every morning with my neighbor, and we had to go around the whole corner because of the water. At my age you don't want to be wading."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you do not. Well, thank you for walking and for calling. Stay out of that water, and keep your photos handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, dear. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-06T11:55:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
